      "content": "\"fundamentally more aligned\"? \"a direct recipe for fueling\"? you're literally using loaded language to shoot down one side while giving the other a pass. you say it's a \"complex, global issue\" but then immediately pivot to saying candidate a is the only one with a \"credible path.\" if it's so complex, how can you be so certain that candidate b is just a recipe for disaster? explain why you've already decided their plan won't work.",
